{"4123450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KABOOM Farm", "steam_appid": 4123450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Now or Never: WELCOME to the Mad World!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient stone tablet glows faintly and the Rookies are longing... for you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Boss! You’re finally here! We have high hopes for you... we guess.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new boss, your mission is super simple: <strong>LET. IT. OUT!</strong> Push and prank your feathered team to rebuild the lost KABOOM Kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/99b5180b6d10d0f9ee2ec1b26611be53.poster.avif?t=1787141416\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/99b5180b6d10d0f9ee2ec1b26611be53.webm?t=1787141416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/99b5180b6d10d0f9ee2ec1b26611be53.mp4?t=1787141416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No more Slackers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop the laziness and unleash their potential! Exploit your team to maximize the income, so you can buy even more pranks and factories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/ec1bf28f0b1be0b73720d9d498eae657.poster.avif?t=1787141416\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/ec1bf28f0b1be0b73720d9d498eae657.webm?t=1787141416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/ec1bf28f0b1be0b73720d9d498eae657.mp4?t=1787141416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/34f8af81b2891559c0505c6033df9e30.poster.avif?t=1787141416\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/34f8af81b2891559c0505c6033df9e30.webm?t=1787141416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/34f8af81b2891559c0505c6033df9e30.mp4?t=1787141416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock the weirdos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Max out the Frenzy meter to unlock mysterious chickens. Each comes with unique skills... to help you troll the flock even harder!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/b7dfbceb74a96ffb5fa416d4dcff0d98.poster.avif?t=1787141416\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/b7dfbceb74a96ffb5fa416d4dcff0d98.webm?t=1787141416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/b7dfbceb74a96ffb5fa416d4dcff0d98.mp4?t=1787141416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/ef4cc796f6c48145780c14edf2845412.avif?t=1787141416\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Sandpit to Empire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the Stone Tablet Bingo to transform the abandoned island into a glorious kingdom. Restore the farm to its former glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/233857287aba287c808a690d14d3e728.poster.avif?t=1787141416\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/233857287aba287c808a690d14d3e728.webm?t=1787141416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/233857287aba287c808a690d14d3e728.mp4?t=1787141416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·         20+ Kaboom Chickens: Each with a &quot;special&quot; personality and breakdown powers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·         10+ Troll Tools: Daily doses of chaos, pranks, and pure joy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·         8+ unique buildings: Expand your kingdom with quirky and wonderful facilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·         🏴‍☠️⚓ Chicken Pirates: Why farm when you can loot? Send your birds to raid nearby islands</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >·         Lucky Gacha: Spin the Kaboom Gacha for rare rewards and legendary loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Now or Never: WELCOME to the Mad World!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient stone tablet glows faintly and the Rookies are longing... for you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Boss! You’re finally here! We have high hopes for you... we guess.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new boss, your mission is super simple: <strong>LET. IT. OUT!</strong> Push and prank your feathered team to rebuild the lost KABOOM Kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/99b5180b6d10d0f9ee2ec1b26611be53.poster.avif?t=1787141416\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/99b5180b6d10d0f9ee2ec1b26611be53.webm?t=1787141416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/99b5180b6d10d0f9ee2ec1b26611be53.mp4?t=1787141416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No more Slackers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stop the laziness and unleash their potential! Exploit your team to maximize the income, so you can buy even more pranks and factories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/ec1bf28f0b1be0b73720d9d498eae657.poster.avif?t=1787141416\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/ec1bf28f0b1be0b73720d9d498eae657.webm?t=1787141416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/ec1bf28f0b1be0b73720d9d498eae657.mp4?t=1787141416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/34f8af81b2891559c0505c6033df9e30.poster.avif?t=1787141416\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/34f8af81b2891559c0505c6033df9e30.webm?t=1787141416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/34f8af81b2891559c0505c6033df9e30.mp4?t=1787141416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock the weirdos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Max out the Frenzy meter to unlock mysterious chickens. Each comes with unique skills... to help you troll the flock even harder!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/b7dfbceb74a96ffb5fa416d4dcff0d98.poster.avif?t=1787141416\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/b7dfbceb74a96ffb5fa416d4dcff0d98.webm?t=1787141416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/b7dfbceb74a96ffb5fa416d4dcff0d98.mp4?t=1787141416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4123450/extras/ef4cc796f6c48145780c14edf2845412.avif?t=1787141416\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Sandpit to Empire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the Stone Tablet Bingo to transform the abandoned island into a glorious kingdom. Restore the farm to its former glory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mu